# Boss_TurretPod_SpawnTurret2 with the object pool out of blocks (ruling 5, 2), at its first call
# (the fuzz-45000 runs): its spawner $02F05A (Obj_SpawnBossUnlinked) finds no free block and fails
# (Z clear), so the pod skips the turret (bne $029130: no var 0, no handle). A full pool is a
# state the game handles; the corpus never fills it (140 blocks).

case pool_empty
b $FFFFF4B0 = 0
